Brand avatar versions
title end

paragraph start
An avatar is the logo cropped into the small round or square frame each platform uses. It must stay recognisable at the smallest display size.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Make one avatar per face, built on the same base so the three look related, and export one file per platform shape.
paragraph end

code start
